FURB192 [*] Prefer `min` over `sorted()` to compute the minimum value in a sequence
  --> FURB192_1.py:9:5
   |
 8 | def f(l, key_fn):
 9 |     sorted((yield))[0]
   |     ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
10 |
11 |     sorted((yield l))[-1]
   |
help: Replace with `min`
   |
